OK: Logged in as ~example-owner with a hardware-bound grant.
Grant stored in /tmp/grant.json.

Now remove the classic bootstrap token, which does not need your key:
1. Revoke the "lpcli" authorization at https://launchpad.net/people/+me/+oauth-tokens
2. Run "lpcli logout --classic" to delete the local copy.
